;; Full order, not just a prefix.  cl-lite appends anything unlisted
;; alphabetically, which put "publish" in the middle -- it has to load
;; LAST, after the ui it publishes.  Spelled out 2026-08-16, when
;; regenerating this system revealed that the committed .asd carried a
;; hand-maintained order this file never described.
("package" "assembly" "body" "chassis" "interior" "rule-ackermann"
 "axle" "frame-rail" "frame" "inter-seat-clearance-check"
 "inter-seat-spacing" "knuckle" "rear-axle" "seat" "seating-section"
 "seating-side" "wheel" "ui" "publish")
